      "name": "semantic_get",
      "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"entities\": [{\"id\": \"SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE\", \"name\": \"SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE\", \"desc\": \"Space supervisor usage fact table: one row per supervisor (MIT_ID) recording how much space they supervise and for how many departments: department count, department DLC key list (comma-separated when multiple), number of supervisees, supervised square footage, research volume, and derived ratio measures (sqft per supervisee, sqft per research volume, research volume per sqft). Joins to SPACE_UNIT and other DLC-carrying tables via DEPT_NAMES = DLC_KEY (only single-department rows match); used for supervisor space-usage and research-volume statistics per department/DLC.\", \"columns\": {\"MIT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"MIT ID of the supervisor; one row per supervisor\"}, \"DEPT_COUNT\": {\"desc\": \"Number of departments (DLCs) the supervisor's space spans; observed values 1-4\"}, \"DEPT_NAMES\": {\"desc\": \"DLC key(s) of the supervised departments, e.g. 'D_CEE'; comma-separated list when DEPT_COUNT > 1 (e.g. 'D_IDSS,D_LIDS'). Single-value rows join to DLC key columns such as SPACE_UNIT.DLC_KEY\"}, \"NUM_OF_SUPERVISEES\": {\"desc\": \"Number of supervisees under the supervisor; observed range 1-121\"}, \"SQFT\": {\"desc\": \"Total square footage of space supervised\"}, \"RESEARCH_VOLUME\": {\"desc\": \"Research volume attributed to the supervisor's space; can be negative\"}, \"SQFT_PER_SUPERVISEE\": {\"desc\": \"Derived ratio: supervised square footage per supervisee\"}, \"SQFT_PER_RES_VOL\": {\"desc\": \"Derived ratio: supervised square footage per unit of research volume\"}, \"RES_VOL_PER_SQFT\": {\"desc\": \"Derived ratio: research volume per square foot of supervised space\"}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per supervisor\"}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per supervisor\"}, {\"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"desc\": \"Space unit dimension table: one row per space unit (an organizational space-assignment unit such as a department, program, or office that receives space allocation), with space unit key/code, space unit name, the facilities organization it belongs to, and DLC key. Bridges FCLT_ORGANIZATION (organization attribution) and SPACE_DETAIL (rooms assigned to the space unit); used to group room counts and space statistics by space unit.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FCLT_ORGANIZATION.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY; the organization that owns/occupies this space unit\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the space unit; joins to SPACE_DETAIL.SPACE_UNIT_KEY and SPACE_UNIT2.SPACE_UNIT_KEY; used for partitioning/ordering in space analyses\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Business code of the space unit (same numeric value as the key in current data)\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT\": {\"desc\": \"Name of the space unit, e.g. 'Physics', 'Technology & Policy Program'\"}, \"DLC_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Department/Lab/Center key, e.g. 'D_PHYSICS'; may contain composite values like 'D_DSL:HQ'\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per space unit\"}, {\"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT2\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT2\", \"desc\": \"Alternative space unit lookup table containing space unit key, code, name, and DLC key, but without the FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY organization attribution present in SPACE_UNIT. Holds fewer space units than SPACE_UNIT; used when only space unit identity/name is needed without organization linkage.\", \"columns\": {\"SPACE_UNIT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the space unit; same value domain as SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_KEY and referenced by SPACE_DETAIL.SPACE_UNIT_KEY\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Business code of the space unit\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT\": {\"desc\": \"Name of the space unit\"}, \"DLC_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Department/Lab/Center key of the space unit\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per space unit\"}, {\"id\": \"column_concept_dlc_key\", \"name\": \"DLC Key (Department/Lab/Center)\", \"desc\": \"Department/Lab/Center key columns (values like 'D_AEROASTRO', 'D_IDSS', 'D_BIOLOGY') identifying a DLC across the facilities, HR, space, and academic-department domains. They are the universal cross-domain join key linking facilities organizations and space units to HR organization units, the master department hierarchy, and academic departments. Naming and completeness vary: DLC_KEY in most tables, D_CODE in MASTER_DEPT_DCODE_PARENT, DLC_CODE in the master hierarchy tables; some columns carry composite values ('D_DSL:HQ') or nulls.\", \"columns\": [\"FCLT_ORGANIZATION.DLC_KEY\", \"FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.DLC_KEY\", \"HR_ORG_UNIT.DLC_KEY\", \"HR_ORG_UNIT_NEW.DLC_KEY\", \"MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.DLC_KEY\", \"MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY_LINKS.DLC_KEY\", \"MASTER_DEPT_DCODE_PARENT.D_CODE\", \"SPACE_UNIT.DLC_KEY\", \"SPACE_UNIT2.DLC_KEY\", \"SIS_DEPARTMENT.DLC_KEY\", \"SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE.DEPT_NAMES\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Naming convention\", \"detail\": \"DLC_KEY is used by FCLT_ORGANIZATION, FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY, HR_ORG_UNIT, HR_ORG_UNIT_NEW, MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY, MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY_LINKS, SPACE_UNIT, SPACE_UNIT2, and SIS_DEPARTMENT; MASTER_DEPT_DCODE_PARENT names the same value domain D_CODE (with PARENT_D_CODE for the parent); MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY/LINKS additionally carry DLC_CODE holding the same value as DLC_KEY; SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE names it DEPT_NAMES despite holding DLC key values, not department names.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Uniqueness and fan-out behavior\", \"detail\": \"In MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY the DLC_KEY is unique per DLC (one row per DLC); in HR_ORG_UNIT one DLC_KEY may appear on multiple HR org unit rows (join fans out); in FCLT_ORGANIZATION multiple organizations can share a DLC_KEY; in FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY it is an assignment bridge where non-null values mark organizations with a DLC assignment; in SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE multiple supervisors can share the same DEPT_NAMES value, so joining DEPT_NAMES = DLC_KEY fans out on both sides.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Nullability and value format\", \"detail\": \"HR_ORG_UNIT.DLC_KEY is null for units without a DLC assignment (133 of 641 rows); HR_ORG_UNIT_NEW.DLC_KEY and SPACE_UNIT.DLC_KEY may contain composite values like 'D_DSL:HQ' that do not match plain DLC keys; SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE.DEPT_NAMES holds a comma-separated list of DLC keys when DEPT_COUNT > 1 (e.g. 'D_IDSS,D_LIDS'), so only single-department rows match a plain DLC key join; SIS_DEPARTMENT.DLC_KEY is populated for all 122 department rows.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Companion name column\", \"detail\": \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION, HR_ORG_UNIT, and MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY carry a DLC_NAME alongside the key; SPACE_UNIT/SPACE_UNIT2, FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY, HR_ORG_UNIT_NEW, SIS_DEPARTMENT, and SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE carry only the key, so DLC name reporting requires joining one of the name-carrying tables.\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Attaching HR department attributes (unit title, department name/code, level) to a facilities organization\": \"Join FCLT_ORGANIZATION.DLC_KEY = HR_ORG_UNIT.DLC_KEY; expect possible row fan-out when a DLC maps to multiple HR org units.\", \"Reporting the DLC name of an organization or space unit\": \"Use FCLT_ORGANIZATION.DLC_KEY (carries DLC_NAME) or join HR_ORG_UNIT/MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY for DLC_NAME; SPACE_UNIT/SPACE_UNIT2 keys alone have no name column.\", \"Restricting analysis to DLCs placed in the standard department hierarchy or reporting their hierarchy path\": \"Join on MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.DLC_KEY; use MASTER_DEPT_DCODE_PARENT.D_CODE for the same value domain when only the direct parent is needed.\", \"Filtering organizations that have a DLC assignment before DLC-level room statistics\": \"Use FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.DLC_KEY IS NOT NULL as the assignment filter, then join FCLT_ORGANIZATION.\", \"Linking an academic department to its facilities organization or HR unit\": \"Use SIS_DEPARTMENT.DLC_KEY = FCLT_ORGANIZATION.DLC_KEY (or HR_ORG_UNIT.DLC_KEY); all SIS_DEPARTMENT rows carry a DLC key.\", \"Attributing supervisor space-usage statistics (supervisees, square footage, research volume) to a DLC or space unit\": \"Join SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE.DEPT_NAMES = SPACE_UNIT.DLC_KEY (or another DLC_KEY column); despite its name, DEPT_NAMES holds DLC key values, and only single-department rows (DEPT_COUNT = 1) match a plain DLC key.\"}}, {\"id\": \"concept_space_unit_dimension\", \"name\": \"Space Unit Dimension\", \"desc\": \"Space unit lookup tables identifying the organizational units that receive space allocation: SPACE_UNIT (with FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY organization attribution) and SPACE_UNIT2 (identity/name only). They answer the same space-unit identity questions but differ in organization linkage and coverage.\", \"tables\": [\"SPACE_UNIT\", \"SPACE_UNIT2\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Organization attribution\", \"differences\": \"SPACE_UNIT carries FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY linking each space unit to its owning organization in FCLT_ORGANIZATION; SPACE_UNIT2 has no organization key, only space unit identity and DLC_KEY.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Coverage\", \"differences\": \"SPACE_UNIT holds more space units (150 rows) than SPACE_UNIT2 (139 rows); every SPACE_UNIT2 key also exists in SPACE_UNIT, so SPACE_UNIT2 is a subset.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Join role\", \"differences\": \"Both join SPACE_DETAIL via SPACE_UNIT_KEY; only SPACE_UNIT can bridge SPACE_DETAIL rooms to organization attributes (level, parent, description).\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Space unit analysis that needs organization attributes (organization level, name, description)\": \"Use SPACE_UNIT: it is the only space unit table carrying FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY for the organization join.\", \"Space unit name/code lookup only, or queries restricted to the SPACE_UNIT2 subset\": \"Use SPACE_UNIT2: it provides SPACE_UNIT_KEY/CODE/NAME and DLC_KEY without organization linkage.\", \"Counting rooms per space unit or ranking space units by room count\": \"Join SPACE_DETAIL to SPACE_UNIT on SPACE_UNIT_KEY (preferred for full coverage and organization attribution).\"}}], \"not_found\": []}"
    },
