      "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"count\": 2, \"items\": [{\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"outgoing\", \"desc\": \"Space unit dimension table: one row per space unit (an organizational space-assignment unit such as a department, program, or office that receives space allocation), with space unit key/code, space unit name, the facilities organization it belongs to, and DLC key. Bridges FCLT_ORGANIZATION (organization attribution) and SPACE_DETAIL (rooms assigned to the space unit); used to group room counts and space statistics by space unit.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"column_concept\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Department/Lab/Center key columns (values like 'D_AEROASTRO', 'D_IDSS', 'D_BIOLOGY') identifying a DLC across the facilities, HR, space, and academic-department domains. They are the universal cross-domain join key linking facilities organizations and space units to HR organization units, the master department hierarchy, and academic departments. Naming and completeness vary: DLC_KEY in most tables, D_CODE in MASTER_DEPT_DCODE_PARENT, DLC_CODE in the master hierarchy tables; some columns carry composite values ('D_DSL:HQ') or nulls.\", \"entity_type\": \"column_concept\", \"id\": \"column_concept_dlc_key\", \"name\": \"DLC Key (Department/Lab/Center)\"}]}"
